{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/cavaliers-of-mars-and-pugmire/1455398-pugmire-mau-other-settlements-of-dogs-cats","id":1455398,"title":"[Pugmire/Mau] Other Settlements of Dogs & Cats","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Partner Worlds","Realms of Pugmire"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-07-22T13:29:56-07:00","id":1455398,"title":"[Pugmire/Mau] Other Settlements of Dogs & Cats","content":"Do Dogs and Cats have other settlements throughout the world? Or are the areas around the Fearful Forest the only cities and towns of our fine furred friends?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Currently Hosting <a href=\"http://opx-finalfrontier.wikidot.com\" target=\"_blank\">Outpost Phoenix</a>, an Non-Affiliated, Live-Action Star Trek <a href=\"https://discord.gg/6zwnyzm\" target=\"_blank\">Discord</a> Sim. New players are always welcome!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11235-arzie","name":"Arzie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11235_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"88"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-22T22:23:46-07:00","id":1455418,"title":"","content":"I advise to look over WHOLE <b>Realms of Pugmire</b> map, made by fans from <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/groups/1174404015998912\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Fans of Realms of Pugmire</b></a> FB group. It has all the locations from official materials - plus some new small addition. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://scontent.frix7-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t1.6435-9/196437102_10223681630942524_1456015261556926884_n.jpg?_nc_cat=100&amp;ccb=1-3&amp;_nc_sid=b9115d&amp;_nc_ohc=rPMvqZRzUKAAX94SR9F&amp;tn=_atwWtszC50sYbP8&amp;_nc_ht=scontent.frix7-1.fna&amp;oh=9406aef971f771dfd9427f312d1742b9&amp;oe=61278A50\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 07-29-2021, 04:49 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-23T05:00:26-07:00","id":1455432,"title":"","content":"Oh rad! Thank you so much! :^)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Currently Hosting <a href=\"http://opx-finalfrontier.wikidot.com\" target=\"_blank\">Outpost Phoenix</a>, an Non-Affiliated, Live-Action Star Trek <a href=\"https://discord.gg/6zwnyzm\" target=\"_blank\">Discord</a> Sim. New players are always welcome!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11235-arzie","name":"Arzie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11235_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"88"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-23T10:42:14-07:00","id":1455447,"title":"","content":"Much of the Realms are deliberately left vague to give storytellers as much flexibility as possible - so that answer\u2019s going to be different in every chronicle. But as some food for thought\u2026<br /> - Pugmire and the Monarchies as described as learning how to sail the acid sea very recently; it probably hasn\u2019t been long enough for their kingdoms to found a colony.<br /> - House Smilodon had settled beyond the Northern mountains, and was overwhelmed by demons, implying that further inland is extremely dangerous.<br /> - When speculating about how Uplifted were created by humanity in the Guide section, it talks about gradual alterations in intelligence and communication for specific (and public) purposes\u2026. At the point that technology is used for disability assistance training, it would probably be available all over the world.<br /> <br /> So my head cannon is that, yes, there are other pockets of Uplifted (probably even Cats and Dogs), but they aren\u2019t related to the kingdoms we know and haven\u2019t made contact with them yet.<br /> This could make a great hook for pirate-explorers\u2026 or even for players to discover ancient texts that allude to other kingdoms in the world, sparking bold missions to venture to lands unknown.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Second Chance for<br /> <img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=709\" data-tempid=\"temp_709_1572548741915_354\" /><br /> A Beautiful Madness</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/425-seraph-kitty","name":"Seraph Kitty","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar425_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-28T05:38:05-07:00","id":1455712,"title":"","content":"Officially as in &quot;what the books say,&quot; there is no reference to any other settlements outside of the area presented.<br /> <br /> Officially as in &quot;what's in Eddy's head,&quot; there are definitely other settlements cut off from this civilization. I don't <i>yet </i>have any plans to dig into them, because as Seraph Kitty mentions, I want to give Guides as much flexibility as possible to shape the world to their own ends (such as with the lovely map up top). But at least one of the ideas I have is <i>very </i>different.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/15-eddyfate","name":"eddyfate","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar15_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"155"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-28T21:42:46-07:00","id":1455743,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>eddyfate</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/cavaliers-of-mars-and-pugmire/1455398-pugmire-mau-other-settlements-of-dogs-cats?p=1455712#post1455712\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Officially as in &amp;quot;what the books say,&amp;quot; there is no reference to any other settlements outside of the area presented.<br /> <br /> Officially as in &amp;quot;what's in Eddy's head,&amp;quot; there are definitely other settlements cut off from this civilization. I don't <i>yet </i>have any plans to dig into them, because as Seraph Kitty mentions, I want to give Guides as much flexibility as possible to shape the world to their own ends (such as with the lovely map up top). But at least one of the ideas I have is <i>very </i>different.</div> </div> </div> </div>For whatever it\u2019s worth, I don\u2019t think digging into a specific example or two that are notably different in anyway would limit guides. On the contrary it would likely help spark their own ideas for other locals and cultures.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-08-04T06:11:26-07:00","id":1456119,"title":"","content":"Thanks for your opinion!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":15,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/15-eddyfate","user":"eddyfate","date":". 08-04-2021, 09:13 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/15-eddyfate","name":"eddyfate","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar15_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"155"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}